{"seq":4,"slug":"major-works","title":"史蒂夫·乔布斯·代表成就","stage":"DONE","category":"steve-jobs","categoryLabel":"史蒂夫·乔布斯","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/major-works","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/32_steve-jobs/4_major-works","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"史蒂夫-乔布斯-代表成就\">史蒂夫·乔布斯·代表成就</h1><p>本 hub 聚焦乔布斯一生最具标志性的&quot;代表作&quot;——既包括改变产业的产品（<a href=\"apple-milestones/the-macintosh\">麦金塔</a>、<a href=\"apple-milestones/the-iphone\">iPhone</a>、<a href=\"reshaping-digital-entertainment/the-ipod-and-itunes\">iPod 与 iTunes</a>、<a href=\"reshaping-digital-entertainment/pixar-and-toy-story\">皮克斯与《玩具总动员》</a>），也包括两件&quot;非物质代表作&quot;——<a href=\"iconic-presentations/the-keynote-as-art\">作为艺术的发布会</a>与<a href=\"iconic-presentations/the-stanford-commencement-speech\">斯坦福毕业演讲</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>代表成就 hub 回答的是&quot;他<strong>做出了哪些具体作品</strong>、每件作品如何诞生与运作&quot;。它与其他五个兄弟 hub 严格分工、互不重复：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他的人生轨迹</td>\n<td>本 hub 不复述生平，只链接相关阶段</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>他对产业的整体贡献</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲单件作品，那里讲产业级影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>他的哲学与方法论</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲作品如何体现方法，那里讲方法本身</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>作品之后的长期回响</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲诞生与机制，那里讲后世重塑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>对其人其事的批评</td>\n<td>本 hub 标注争议并链接，不展开论辩</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>去重原则：同一事实只在主篇展开。例如 iPhone 的产业冲击在<a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/reshaping-industries/phones-and-mobile-computing\">手机与移动计算</a>展开，本 hub 的 iPhone 篇只链接；署名争议在<a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/management-and-character/credit-and-collaboration\">署名与协作</a>展开，各篇仅标注。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  M[麦金塔 1984&lt;br/&gt;方法论原型] --&gt; I[iPod+iTunes 2001&lt;br/&gt;生态闭环预演]&#10;  M --&gt; P[皮克斯 1986-1995&lt;br/&gt;创意产业]&#10;  I --&gt; Ph[iPhone 2007&lt;br/&gt;集大成]&#10;  P -.叙事经验.-&gt; K[发布会艺术]&#10;  Ph --&gt; K&#10;  K --&gt; S[斯坦福演讲 2005&lt;br/&gt;人文内核]\">flowchart TD\n  M[麦金塔 1984&lt;br/&gt;方法论原型] --&gt; I[iPod+iTunes 2001&lt;br/&gt;生态闭环预演]\n  M --&gt; P[皮克斯 1986-1995&lt;br/&gt;创意产业]\n  I --&gt; Ph[iPhone 2007&lt;br/&gt;集大成]\n  P -.叙事经验.-&gt; K[发布会艺术]\n  Ph --&gt; K\n  K --&gt; S[斯坦福演讲 2005&lt;br/&gt;人文内核]</pre><ol>\n<li>先读 <a href=\"apple-milestones/the-macintosh\">麦金塔</a>：它是乔布斯方法论的&quot;原型&quot;，后续作品都是它的放大与精炼。</li>\n<li>再读 <a href=\"reshaping-digital-entertainment/the-ipod-and-itunes\">iPod 与 iTunes</a>：理解&quot;硬件＋软件＋服务&quot;闭环如何为 iPhone 铺路。</li>\n<li>然后 <a href=\"apple-milestones/the-iphone\">iPhone</a>：它是前述所有要素的集大成。</li>\n<li>并行阅读 <a href=\"reshaping-digital-entertainment/pixar-and-toy-story\">皮克斯与《玩具总动员》</a>：看乔布斯在创意产业的另一面。</li>\n<li>最后两篇发布会与演讲，理解他&quot;沟通即产品价值&quot;的洞见与人文内核。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置知识\">前置知识</h2><p>无需技术背景。若想了解作品诞生的人生语境，建议先浏览<a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>；若想先掌握贯穿各作品的方法论，可先读<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/product-philosophy/simplicity-and-focus\">简约与专注</a>与<a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/vision-and-taste/taste-and-aesthetics\">品味与美学</a>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>#</th>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td><a href=\"apple-milestones/\">苹果里程碑</a></td>\n<td>麦金塔、iPhone</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td><a href=\"reshaping-digital-entertainment/\">重塑数字娱乐</a></td>\n<td>iPod 与 iTunes、皮克斯与《玩具总动员》</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td><a href=\"iconic-presentations/\">标志性演讲</a></td>\n<td>作为艺术的发布会、斯坦福毕业演讲</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"apple-milestones","title":"苹果的里程碑产品","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/major-works/apple-milestones","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-macintosh","title":"麦金塔电脑","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/major-works/apple-milestones/the-macintosh"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-iphone","title":"iPhone 智能手机","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/major-works/apple-milestones/the-iphone"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"reshaping-digital-entertainment","title":"重塑数字娱乐","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/major-works/reshaping-digital-entertainment","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-ipod-and-itunes","title":"iPod 与 iTunes","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/major-works/reshaping-digital-entertainment/the-ipod-and-itunes"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pixar-and-toy-story","title":"皮克斯与《玩具总动员》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/major-works/reshaping-digital-entertainment/pixar-and-toy-story"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"iconic-presentations","title":"标志性的发布与演讲","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/major-works/iconic-presentations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-keynote-as-art","title":"作为艺术的发布会","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/major-works/iconic-presentations/the-keynote-as-art"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-stanford-commencement-speech","title":"斯坦福毕业演讲","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/steve-jobs/major-works/iconic-presentations/the-stanford-commencement-speech"}]}]}